{"term":"poisonous","senses":[{"id":"kaikki:d78c25cded0301488c","definition":"Containing sufficient poison to be dangerous to touch or ingest.","example":"While highly poisonous to dogs, this substance is completely harmless if ingested by humans.","pos":"adj","synonyms":["poisoned","toxic","venomous","attery"],"antonyms":["nonpoisonous","unpoisonous"],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"","wordFamily":["autopoisonous","fruit of the poisonous tree","nonpoisonous","poisonous compliment","poisonously","poisonousness","unpoisonous"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/poisonous#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:d2b41136b900a4617d","definition":"Of an animal such as a snake or spider, or parts of its body: producing a toxin intended for defensive or offensive use which is usually injected into an enemy or prey by biting or stinging; hence, of a bite or sting: injecting poison.","example":"Poisonous snakes should only be handled by experienced professionals.","pos":"adj","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"proscribed, sometimes","register":"proscribed, sometimes","wordFamily":["autopoisonous","fruit of the poisonous tree","nonpoisonous","poisonous compliment","poisonously","poisonousness","unpoisonous"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/poisonous#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:3f89b1cecdb4f21e02","definition":"Negative, harmful.","example":"He didn't want to end up like his grandfather, bitter and intractable, consumed in his hatred like an addict on haze — a poisonous attitude that would possess him all his remaining years.","pos":"adj","synonyms":["toxic"],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"figuratively","register":"figuratively","wordFamily":["autopoisonous","fruit of the poisonous tree","nonpoisonous","poisonous compliment","poisonously","poisonousness","unpoisonous"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/poisonous#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"}],"pronunciation":{"ipa":"/ˈpɔɪzənəs/"},"wordFamily":["autopoisonous","fruit of the poisonous tree","nonpoisonous","poisonous compliment","poisonously","poisonousness","unpoisonous"]}